      "title": "Lua: update globals and test for 5.0 release",
      "message": "Lua: update globals and test for 5.0 release\n\nThis was skipped for 4.6, but create one for the next release, 5.0\n\nRegenerate the globals file for the current master branch with\n./run/tshark -r ../wireshark/test/captures/empty.pcap -X lua_script:../wireshark/test/lua/verify_globals.lua -X lua_script1: > globals_5.0.txt\n",
